<title>PORTUGAL: Ylds rise at Bank/Portugal draining operation.</title>
<headline>Ylds rise at Bank/Portugal draining operation.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said that it drained 43 billion escudos of four-week funds at 5.8970 percent, against 5.8452 percent previously.</p>
<p>It drained five billion escudos of nine-week funds at 5.8440 percent against 5.8133 percent.</p>
<p>The last such operations were on April 16.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
